  "version": 1,
  "about": "Let-go habit rules (API v1.21) shared by Core and the no-account client. Days run from `from` through `today` (user-local, timezone UTC, the habit's start day is startDate). State precedence: beforestart, slipped, paused, free. daysFree counts free days after the last slip (or from the start) through today, skipping paused days; longestStretch is the longest such run ever; freeDaysThisMonth counts free days of today's calendar month; slipDaysLast30 counts slipped days in the 30 days ending today.",
